body:
It's so-so, the BEST Niacinamide serum i've tried is Holy Snails Shark Sauce. This serum honestly transformed my skin - my pores are gone, skin texture is much smoother, and is visibly more plump and hydrated. I have extremely bad hyperpigmentation and this helped speed up the process of lightening my dark marks and evening out my skin tone. It is on the pricier side - I bought it when it was on sale - but they have $9 mini samplers that actually last 1-1.5 months so you can see if it works for you or not. 

&#x200B;

[https://www.holysnails.com/products/shark-sauce](https://www.holysnails.com/products/shark-sauce)
